quiz.prompt:
At the start, sayi = 0. While this program runs, the buttons A, A, B, A are pressed in this order:

```
card.onButton("A", "press", () => {
  sayi += 2;
  screen.showNumber(sayi);
});
card.onButton("B", "press", () => {
  sayi += -1;
  screen.showNumber(sayi);
});
```

Which number is on the screen after the last press?

Baran's counter shows 0 on the first press and 1 on the second press; so it is always one behind:

```
card.onButton("A", "press", () => {
  screen.showNumber(sayi);
  sayi += 1;
});
```

Where is the problem?
